# Build-context whitelist (tools/container/README.md §2/§4): the staged
# context carries only what the Dockerfile COPYs — the Dockerfile, the
# hongscanner binary, serve.py and the calendar INDEX. Everything else
# is excluded. In particular the real calendars/*.json are gitignored
# user data and never enter an image or a build context; only the
# git-tracked calendars/CALENDAR_INDEX.sha256 passes.
*
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!bin
bin/*
!bin/hongscanner
!tools
tools/*
!tools/api
tools/api/*
!tools/api/serve.py
!calendars
calendars/*
!calendars/CALENDAR_INDEX.sha256
